ular\n- **III.** ${A}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $A$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${A}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."} {:db/id 17592186120426 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76bc55da-83d7-5857-aa45-f67452354c98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186439761} {:answer/id #uuid "04de8af5-832b-52ca-a350-f0f854ef704b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186439762}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "76bc55da-83d7-5857-aa45-f67452354c98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186439761} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c2bf384-0f31-5769-a66a-ac9626e09eb9" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186440238} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae221432-f0bc-5791-a903-4cd7033afbd0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186439763} {:answer/id #uuid "b1f39cf2-a8e6-5e3d-af10-2464a548d981" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186439764}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b1f39cf2-a8e6-5e3d-af10-2464a548d981" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/