n- **I.** $B$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $B$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $B-{B}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -5 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id 17592186262617 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eb56e3e4-d13e-506f-b457-467943ab9482" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437746} {:answer/id #uuid "86262feb-536d-5ef8-afcc-c7b14bc45026" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "86262feb-536d-5ef8-afcc-c7b14bc45026" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437747} :answer-field/id #uuid "1080d492-9821-5364-8530-4c7dbd0bd3c0" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438902} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a0f61d8-2bc9-5ba5-8d56-d3b975c8bf07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437748} {:answer/id #uuid "0e783ddd-e977-54e7-8580-da07e92b8e98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437749}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e783ddd-e977-54e7-8580-da07e92b8e98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437749} :answer-field/id #uuid "771187b2-e28f-5a7d-a91d-34f73489e1ad" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438903} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "520ef5db-e43e-5e23-92a0-3ed7c62386b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437750} {:answer/id #uuid "6e998b87-0e1c-59a3-830c-e099cf52d227" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437751}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e998b87-0e1c-59a3-830c-e099cf52d227" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437751} :answer-field/id #uuid "c1bcc754-87e4-5cec-9f4e-5a5e7e36cb54" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438904}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f41ff7d0-b754-5033-a620-53eef8a376e3" :question/math-academy-id "q-126479" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$C=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{aligned}].$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $C$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $C$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** ${C}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of $C$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $C$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${C}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III\"."} {:db/id 17592186262618 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fbb2fac-47b6-5bca-8490-fe78f86c36be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437752} {:answer/id #uuid "a79d2921-bc2e-5736-ba05-a01f24841be1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437753}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0fbb2fac-47b6-5bca-8490-fe78f86c36be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437752} :answer-field/id #uuid "5f459b66-0738-5236-8dd3-52a31064b6f5" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438905} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "604f880c-2e1e-517e-a3c7-ef164e3b3d96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437754} {:answer/id #uuid "a443e628-f92b-5017-95b2-5e8bba5b46fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437755}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a443e628-f92b-5017-95b2-5e8bba5b46fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437755} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e5203b2-20a0-5e9e-a92d-30a5804f233d" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438906} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8fb1ade4-2d9c-553f-b227-e71d2d355d0b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437756} {:answer/id #uuid "a1accfd8-f860-523b-b6c2-17f3e9aa8cf7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437757}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8fb1ade4-2d9c-553f-b227-e71d2d355d0b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437756} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a592820-3f24-5c9e-bdb8-cd5757ee23e0" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438907}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a03e6ad4-897b-5475-96e7-f211a321e037" :question/math-academy-id "q-126484" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$B=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{aligned}].$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $B$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $B$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** ${B}^{T}$ is lower triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $B$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $B$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since $B$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\n{B}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"."} {:db/id 17592186269146 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "625bfb45-fbfc-5c45-8a45-c019c11a0ebf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437914} {:answer/id #uuid "24d952bc-2191-54a7-991a-b406bdb29aee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437915}] :answer-field/correct {:answe