\n- **II.** $A$ is lower triangular\n\n- **III.** ${A}^{T}+A$ is lower triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries below the main diagonal are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true, since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true, since the result of $A+{A}^{T}$ has all the entries above the main diagonal equal to zero: \n\n$$\n{A}^{T}+A=[\\begin{aligned}16 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III\"."} {:db/id 17592186326929 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "99c6bb28-f335-5bbd-98ef-7c10debcd116" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186438308} {:answer/id #uuid "f443bd43-943d-5991-a1db-7e129b593206" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186438309}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f443bd43-943d-5991-a1db-7e129b593206" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186438309} :answer-field/id #uuid "cbe78ff6-d1f1-58f5-8add-6b463affc7cc" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186439183} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e07dc0e6-51e2-5ce8-a1b4-44727450bef9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186438310} {:answer/id #uuid "cef77811-df7c-59ed-a36f-ed5228a3ebc8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186438311}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e07dc0e6-51e2-5ce8-a1b4-44