r\n- **III.** ${C}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of $C$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $C$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since ${C}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id 17592186342195 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31f0fe91-c16f-5c88-98c3-6c20947ef352" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186438508} {:answer/id #uuid "e7ecd97a-ece8-52f9-9c37-9224155d587f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186438509}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "31f0fe91-c16f-5c88-98c3-6c20947ef352" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186438508} :answer-field/id #uuid "2f499a2d-45d0-590b-973b-c8d0cb52b220" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186439283} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "128b04a8-57bd-5b61-874d-aac65e3e9c51" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186438510} {:answer/id #uuid "a75398e2-65af-5bac-9ad1-259f5a296fa1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186438511}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a75398e2-